{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_packing_profiles_document", "label": "Packing profiles and staff-selected EL rules", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_reviewed_sku_packing_profiles", "label": "Reviewed SKU packing profiles", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L27", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "4. Mark classifications and measurements reviewed. A missing firmness or pack measurement blocks automatic packing only for orders that need that profile. 5. In **Box catalogue**, review the safe net-weight capacity for the workbook box. Packing space is estimated as 92% of external length \u00d7 width \u00d7 height."}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_staff_selected_el_mode", "label": "Staff-selected EL mode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "boxes. Country and route never choose EL mode. Each box records the selected mode; it can be changed individually before locking if its contents still pass validation. 7. Review occupied volume, calculated net weight, and the bottom-to-top list:"}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_workbook_only_external_box_sizes", "label": "Workbook-only external box sizes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 25 October update uses only the 15 external box sizes from `documents/box size/100726 Dimention (1).xlsx` (Packing Report, rows 4\u201318). The separate internal-measurement fields are removed. Dimensions are fixed to the workbook; staff maintain safe weight limits and availability."}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_firmness_handling_layers", "label": "Firmness handling layers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "hard items, semi-hard items, then soft items. All other compatibility checks remain active. Layers are handling instructions, not exact 3D positions or a calculated crushing-load guarantee. 8. Finalize packing without Scale Net or Scale Gross entry. Totals still derive"}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_snapshot_freshness", "label": "Snapshot freshness", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Packing snapshots record the product/profile revisions, box capacities, selected EL mode, and per-pack volumes used by the plan. Editing relevant setup data flags affected unfinished boxes. Finalization and floor adjustments are blocked until staff review a current plan."}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_reviewed_replan_preview", "label": "Reviewed replan preview", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L89", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Previews expire after 15 minutes. If an order or its setup data changes in the meantime, applying the old preview fails without deleting current boxes. Reopen the preview and review the current result. Changes are audited with their editor."}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_locked_shipping_dimensions", "label": "Locked shipping dimensions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L94", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "save their external shipping dimensions so later catalogue edits cannot change their freight calculations. Previously signed snapshots remain historical. ## API and rollout"}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_derived_box_weight", "label": "Derived box weight", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "from saved packed items, with the existing 0.5 kg packaging allowance per box. The product's **EL classification** identifies it. The box's **EL/Non-EL mode** decides whether EL-specific separation is enforced. There is no Norway/NGA"}, {"id": "docs_packing_profiles_reviewed_data_activation_flag", "label": "Reviewed-data activation flag", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L129", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "`PACKING_PROFILES_ENABLED=true` is the default and enforces reviewed data. For a staged rollout, temporarily set it to `false` while staff populate profiles; this retains the legacy volume fallback. Restore `true` before using reviewed planning operationally. Explicit staff-selected EL mode remains independent of"}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_packing_profiles_document", "target": "docs_packing_profiles_reviewed_sku_packing_profiles", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L27", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_packing_profiles_document", "target": "docs_packing_profiles_staff_selected_el_mode", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_location": "L34", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_packing_profiles_document", "target": "docs_packing_profiles_workbook_only_external_box_sizes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/PACKING_PROFILES.md", "source_loc